  "description": "363 Kildare Road, Crumlin, Dublin 12 – D12 EH5F\n\nThis well-presented property is ideally located on Kildare Road in the established residential area of Crumlin, Dublin 12. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation, excellent storage and a convenient location close to a wide range of local amenities.\nThe accommodation comprises a bright and comfortable living room, a main bedroom with extensive fitted wardrobe space, a second bedroom, and a well-maintained family bathroom. The property also benefits from ample built-in storage throughout.\nThe location is particularly convenient, with Crumlin Village and its selection of shops, cafés, pharmacies, services and local amenities within easy reach. The area also benefits from a number of nearby supermarkets and shopping facilities, including Tesco Express, as well as local cafés, restaurants and everyday conveniences. Ireland Streets\nThere are excellent public transport links nearby, with Dublin Bus services including the 150 operating close to Kildare Road, providing connections towards the City Centre and Limekiln Avenue. Other nearby routes provide connections towards areas including Dundrum, Terenure, Rathfarnham and Tallaght. National Transport\nThe property is also conveniently positioned close to Crumlin Village, Crumlin Road, Sundrive Road and Walkinstown, with easy access to a wide range of schools, healthcare facilities, recreational amenities and shopping destinations. Children’s Health Ireland at Crumlin is also located nearby. \n\nKey Features:\n- Well-presented residential property\n- Three bedrooms\n- Spacious main bedroom with extensive fitted wardrobes\n- Comfortable living room\n- Well-maintained bathroom\n- Excellent storage throughout\n- Established residential location\n- Close to Crumlin Village and local amenities\n- Excellent public transport links\n- Convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas",
